      195.21,
      203.45,
      368.49,
      227.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CONSTITUTION OF THEDEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      241.49,
      401.9,
      265.55
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      279.65,
      401.85,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Twenty SecondAmendment to the Constitution.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      317.69,
      401.87,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "2.Aritcle 99A of the Constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka (hereinafter referred to as\u201cthe Constitution\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      368.45,
      401.86,
      405.23
    ],
    "text": "(i)By the insertion of the following provisoimmediately after the second paragraph of thisArticle:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      419.33,
      401.89,
      468.71
    ],
    "text": "\u201cProvided that each political party andindependent group shall include not less than50 per centum of women members in their listunder this Article.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      176.85,
      482.81,
      401.9,
      519.47
    ],
    "text": "(ii)By the insertion of the following provisoimmediately after the third paragraph of thisArticle:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      533.57,
      401.87,
      621.11
    ],
    "text": "\u201cProvided that the Commissioner ofElections shall request the Secretary of suchrecognized political party or group leader of suchindependent group to nominate not less than 50per centum of women members under this Articleto represent such political party or theindependent group in Parliament.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.85,
      634.25,
      401.87,
      659.99
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
